# Copy to snmpv3.local.cfg (same directory, ignored by git), then set the real
# SNMPv3 passwords used by the *_v3 commands (authPriv, SHA + AES).
# In this file write "$$" for a literal "$"; avoid "'" (the commands put the
# value between single quotes). The passwords are visible in "ps" on the
# poller, like any plugin argument.
$SNMPV3AUTHPASS$=change-me-auth
$SNMPV3PRIVPASS$=change-me-priv
